{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/10/15/4243614/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"や(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の写真がないから\n肩とか出てるけど気にしないで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今日はひとりで撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたたかいスタッフの皆様、\n素敵な環境の中で\nのびのびとお仕事できたこと幸せに思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか詳しくお知らせできるまで\n楽しみに待ってて下さい(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/10/15/4243614/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の夜は、らじらー！サンデー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回のゲストは\n声優アーツに下地紫野さん、\n乃木坂から西野七瀬ちゃんの登場です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募集中のメールテーマは\n◯なぁちゃんへの応援メッセージ\n◯RAPで教えてNOGIZAKA CHAN\n◯七瀬への七つの質問\n◯ひとりノリひめたん\n◯妄想デート\n◯カメレオン対決～◯◯風に着替えて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宛先はこちら\nhttp://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふつおたやリクエストソングなどなど\nお待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/10/15/4243614/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売のEX大衆さんにて解禁になりました\nサンクエトワール再始動！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再始動ってか\n新曲いただけたよ～ってお話ですね。\nありがたき( ˆωˆ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、まだ記事チェックできてないんだけれど\n曲のこととかお話してんのかな？\n新曲解禁楽しみにしてて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/10/15/4243614/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央ちゃんお誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はったちー！同い年！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}